{"file": "永冬之下，冻土之上-第41集.mp4", "ep": 41, "duration": 51.6, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.6, "text": "而那些真正放毒气的"}, {"start": 1.6, "end": 2.92, "text": "纯粹的石头杂质"}, {"start": 2.92, "end": 3.72, "text": "笔重大"}, {"start": 3.96, "end": 4.44, "text": "沉"}, {"start": 5.12, "end": 6.28, "text": "全沉到了缸底"}, {"start": 7.82, "end": 8.74, "text": "这就是水洗"}, {"start": 9.1, "end": 9.9, "text": "靠着清的福"}, {"start": 10.06, "end": 10.7, "text": "重的沉"}, {"start": 10.86, "end": 11.74, "text": "把能烧的好炭"}, {"start": 11.82, "end": 12.7, "text": "和放毒的石头"}, {"start": 12.94, "end": 13.46, "text": "分开"}, {"start": 13.94, "end": 14.38, "text": "这"}, {"start": 14.46, "end": 16.5, "text": "这居然全都是黑亮黑亮的炭子了"}, {"start": 16.7, "end": 17.42, "text": "神了"}, {"start": 17.62, "end": 17.86, "text": "你"}, {"start": 17.86, "end": 19.26, "text": "你居然真的用一缸水"}, {"start": 19.26, "end": 20.18, "text": "把那毒石头"}, {"start": 20.3, "end": 21.38, "text": "给洗成好炭了"}, {"start": 21.94, "end": 23.18, "text": "这就是京梅的渣子"}, {"start": 23.85, "end": 24.65, "text": "它烧起来"}, {"start": 24.97, "end": 25.57, "text": "弄暗"}, {"start": 25.97, "end": 26.61, "text": "不枪人"}, {"start": 35.69, "end": 36.33, "text": "停手"}, {"start": 36.33, "end": 37.01, "text": "牟川哥"}, {"start": 37.25, "end": 38.01, "text": "这黑炭子"}, {"start": 38.01, "end": 38.65, "text": "咱们好不容易"}, {"start": 38.65, "end": 39.57, "text": "才用水洗干净"}, {"start": 39.57, "end": 40.97, "text": "你怎么反手又把这臭泥巴"}, {"start": 41.17, "end": 42.17, "text": "给搅和进去了"}, {"start": 42.33, "end": 43.33, "text": "这下全完了"}, {"start": 43.61, "end": 44.53, "text": "泥巴混进去"}, {"start": 44.53, "end": 45.13, "text": "这不又变成"}, {"start": 45.13, "end": 46.53, "text": "一堆没用的土哥的了吗"}, {"start": 46.73, "end": 47.37, "text": "我说了"}, {"start": 48.15, "end": 49.03, "text": "咱们要烧的"}, {"start": 49.47, "end": 50.23, "text": "就是泥土"}]}